  "description": "XEDDOA crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C114 H122 La6 N26 O20 6+,6(C1 F3 O3 S1 1-),6(C2 H3 N1). From the CIF bond table, La1 (La) has 3 O neighbors; La2 (La) has 4 O neighbors; La3 (La) has 8 O neighbors; La1A (La) has 3 O neighbors; La2A (La) has 4 O neighbors; La3A (La) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 7 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 4.109-4.955 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 105.96-153.61°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C132H140F18N32O38S6La6. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
